WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.438
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:05.704
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.704 --> 00:00:09.204
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.204 --> 00:00:09.525
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:11.770
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.459
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:24.386
Correct the first claim: training updates parameters, ordinary inference uses them.

00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:27.686
Reveal the first expected explanation and compare it with the correction.

00:00:27.686 --> 00:00:32.907
Read the first expected explanation and its chapter reference.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:41.642
Correct the second claim by distinguishing new context from learned parameters.

00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:45.405
Reveal and read the expected explanation about prompt context.

00:00:45.405 --> 00:00:54.725
Correct the retrieval claim without confusing retrieved context with training.

00:00:54.725 --> 00:01:00.264
Reveal and compare the third expected explanation.

00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:05.533
Inspect the completed counter: three answers and three explanations.

00:01:05.533 --> 00:01:12.576
Reset the written responses and explanations for another attempt.
